  to: 
}

docs {
  # Chat Stats

  Returns chat analytics for a date range:
  - total messages
  - breakdown by status (sent/delivered/read/failed)
  - breakdown by type (text/image/file)
  - room counts (total / active)

  ## Query params
  - from, to — ISO date strings
}
